hifi lab (CONFIG_HIFI_LAB): the party experiment (components/hifi/esp/lab_party.c,
with core/hifi_party.c and hifi_party_sync.c) links into the app only, like
patches 0017 and 0027 do for the Bluetooth and FLAC ones: with it, the lab's
recovery image was 0x110 bytes over its 0x1c0000 slot. Lab images only.

